# REDIS_HOST to the US primary's private tunnel IP. Keep DB names, Redis DB,
# passwords, JWT_SECRET and TOTP_ENCRYPTION_KEY identical. No second writable DB.
# Size DATABASE_MAX_OPEN_CONNS and REDIS_POOL_SIZE for the total of all nodes.
